# Spec file for tools/cards/newcard.py. Plan: docs/art/CA.md. Aligned with the CB and CC sets on 14 Oct 2026:
# the contract (views, densities, materials, manifest) is docs/art/CARS_ALIGN.md. Hero/default view = SIDE (Lee, 14 Oct 2026): flank detail first, front/rear parts feed the face portrait. CA21-CA24 were dropped (CB owns cameras, pixel stage, sprites).
BL = ("Blender 5.2 is at `/opt/homebrew/bin/blender`; run `/opt/homebrew/bin/blender --background --python-exit-code 1 "
      "--python tools/art/blender_car2.py -- --dossier tests/fixtures/dossier_ok.json --out /tmp/x.png --report` "
      "(everything after the lone `--` is for the script). Blender's Python has bpy, bmesh, mathutils, numpy and NOT PIL. "
      "You cannot see images: check numbers (the `--report` lines `REPORT <object name> dx=.. dy=.. dz=..`).")
