  "`@register('mirror')`: styles `round` (chrome disc r `size` on a 3-unit stalk, on the wing top), `rect` (black rectangle), `door` (chrome rectangle on a short arm at the door front, `lat = half_width + 2.5`), `wing` (round on the front wing, stalk 4 high); `@register('badge')`: `end` front: on the nose face at `x = surf.xmax - 0.2`, lat 0; rear: on the tail at `x = surf.xmin + 0.2`; side: on the flank; shapes disc (cylinder r size, depth 0.3, colour per `colour`: chrome, red `#c8201e`, blue `#1e4fa0`, gold `#d9a520`, black), bar (box 3*size x 0.8*size), shield (a disc scaled 0.8 wide, 1.1 high), wings (a thin chrome box 4*size wide with two sloped end boxes), script (a thin chrome box 3*size long, 0.5*size high: a stand-in for lettering). `@register('wiper')`: n arms, each a black box `len` long, 0.3 thick, resting at -10 degrees from horizontal on the windscreen base at `(x, y)`, lat spaced 0.28*half_width apart. `@register('aerial')`: black thin cylinder, `len` high, tilted 12 degrees back, with a chrome tip sphere. `@register('fuelcap')`: chrome disc r on the flank (one side by default).",
  "Names `mirror_<i>_<s>`, `badge_<i>_<s>`, `wiper_<i>_c`, `aerial_<i>_<s>`, `fuelcap_<i>_<s>`. " + blender_test("run_ca14.sh", "`tests/fixtures/details_fittings.json` (create it: dossier_ok, 2 handles (flap, bar), 1 mirror door both, 3 badges (front disc red, rear script, side shield), 1 wiper n 2, 1 aerial, 1 fuelcap near)", "at least 4 `REPORT handle_`, 2 `REPORT mirror_`, 3 `REPORT badge_` lines, 1 `REPORT wiper_`, 1 `REPORT aerial_`, 1 `REPORT fuelcap_` line"),
